The American Mathematical Society has an open position in the
Publications Technical Group.  This position requires the candidate to
possess expert knowledge of LaTeX/TeX internals.  Other qualifications
include knowledge of XML/MathML, the ability to work in both Unix and
VMS environments, knowledge of book publishing (both print and online).
Responsibilities will include development and maintenance of AMS LaTeX
and TeX products, management of publishing-related projects, high level
planning for the Publications Division, and various support functions
for staff, authors and mathematicians.

A complete description of the position is posted on the AMS website:
    http://www.ams.org/ams/PublicationsTechnicalSpecialist.pdf


Janet Simoneau
Administrator
Publications Technical Group

